{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05315","headline":"奉和九月九日登慈恩寺浮图应制 · 李从远","name":"奉和九月九日登慈恩寺浮图应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"九月从时豫，三乘爲法开。\n中霄日天子，半座宝如来。\n摘果珠盘献，攀萸玉辇回。\n愿将尘露点，遥奉光明台。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李从远","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05315.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05315","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}